    <p>Finance reminder for managers:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Submit expenses within 14 days of the transaction in Coupa.</li>
      <li>Receipts are required above $25. Itemized receipts are required for meals.</li>
      <li>Client meals are capped at $75 per person. Alcohol needs VP approval.</li>
      <li>Use the corporate card for travel. Personal cards are only allowed if the vendor cannot take the corporate card.</li>
      <li>Home-office equipment over $200 must go through IT procurement, not expenses.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Missing receipts will be rejected. For exceptions contact finance@company.internal or call 555-0100 and quote employee ID EMP-20481.</p>
    <p>Priya Nair<br/>Finance Operations</p>
